From: isp <40058476+isprogrammer@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: qcom: msm8916 call audio (q6voice, internal BT SCO, in-call record/playback)

q6voice from msm8916-mainline (Stephan Gerhold), plus:
- q6afe: internal BT SCO ports and the voice record/playback pseudo ports
- q6routing: VOC_REC_DL/UL capture and VOICE_PLAYBACK_TX playback
- q6voice: BT SCO port mixers, CS/VoLTE session select, in-call record
  taps, in-call playback through a CVS passive session, and a vocproc
  TX mute ("Voice Tx Mute") so the playback goes out without the mic
- msm8916 qdsp6 card: non-MI2S backends without LPASS/codec setup
- dts: q6mvm/q6cvs/q6cvp nodes; voice sound card for the UFI sticks

---
